{{ ref: d1320be8-3f9b-40ca-8268-3b837307b5be }}
- **Scope**: `crates/core/src/shatter.rs` plus the `highs` dependency. Consumes condensation SCCs from commit 2; conditional-split wiring comes later (commit 5).
