{{ ref: 80e8367c-8a1f-4b8f-948d-386d954e422e }}
- **Description**: Per-SCC minimum feedback arc set suggestions — the product's most actionable output. Exact ILP with lazy cycle constraints for SCCs up to `ilp-threshold` (default 300); Eades–Lin–Smyth ordering with local search above the threshold or on timeout. Every result carries an `exact` flag so heuristic answers never masquerade as proofs (AD-7).
--{ ref: 80e8367c-8a1f-4b8f-948d-386d954e422e }--

